,{"category":"Bars","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Burgers","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Breakfast & Brunch","historical_business_count":1}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"j4kYliTkKf7k-oDqVgyXYA","review_id":"PYJM9SmCUuD_wWjAr5dGTA","date":"2012-06-24T23:30:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9474465250968933,"text_excerpt":"Great bar/restaurant. This is one of the more updated/modern joints therefore it is a spacious, and very nice place. A group of us went here for dinner as well as to watch the NBA quarterfinals game. Manning's did not disappoint because they might have literally 50 wide screens, or more, displaying the game. All-in-all it was a pleasant experience and I would go back here again. The vegetarian pasta was very good. The service was sub-par, because it was a busy night."},{"business_id":"j4kYliTkKf7k-oDqVgyXYA","review_id":"vdn6MuQVu9X17JUPUIlwnQ","date":"2013-04-13T19:27:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9349997043609619,"text_excerpt":"Manning's has some of the best grits I've ever eaten and you bet your ever-expanding a$$ there's probably all kinds of heavy cream, butter and other very very bad things in there that make 'em taste so good. But hey, this is New Orleans, hardly a town known for reeling it in, y'know? How good? Better than Cochon- good, how's that for you? On par with Maurepas. Possibly better than Maurepas. DANGood!!! The best part about it is that there's jalapeños in there which makes it even better. I recently learned that there's a new chef in the kitchen and a new GM lording over the realm so this isn't the Mannings you used to know. I had a pretty amazing lunch here recently. There are vegetarian op..."},{"business_id":"j4kYliTkKf7k-oDqVgyXYA","review_id":"3ITM-v_kMV3BO2sxGnwZQA","date":"2017-11-09T07:10:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9297209978103638,"text_excerpt":"Mannings is one of my favorite places to come and watch a game in New Orleans. They have a huge courtyard with a big screen tv with sofas , chairs, bar benches and tables, whatever you like. I ride my bike and take a seat on the couch and on a nice day or night its a pleasant experience. There is nobody hounding you to buy food or drinks and a convenient window to order when you are ready. The food or drinks come to you by your assigned number at your location. Of the food I have had much of it has not been that good though I did have a pulled pork special that was great and a huge cobb salad for only $10 which is a deal. What makes this place the winner for me is the courtyard location."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"j4kYliTkKf7k-oDqVgyXYA","photo_id":"vvS_NHCcHTN_BiejxsbAsg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/vvS_NHCcHTN_BiejxsbAsg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8377476334571838},{"business_id":"j4kYliTkKf7k-oDqVgyXYA","photo_id":"JNRzbNPluep-ILh5XKQQ0w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JNRzbNPluep-ILh5XKQQ0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7991361021995544},{"business_id":"j4kYliTkKf7k-oDqVgyXYA","photo_id":"JLdd-PFMsC0Z2F89joUzUQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/JLdd-PFMsC0Z2F89joUzUQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7941216230392456},{"business_id":"j4kYliTkKf7k-oDqVgyXYA","photo_id":"RKX8x5QRq7w-zF5fdo_L6g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/RKX8x5QRq7w-zF5fdo_L6g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7767878174781799},{"business_id":"j4kYliTkKf7k-oDqVgyXYA","photo_id":"r_MWXt40Jur6xgP2mhcV_Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/r_MWXt40Jur6xgP2mhcV_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7496302127838135}]},"notebook_case":null}
